<p class="p1" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span class="s1" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="3">Hi&nbsp;</font></span><font size="3">{!Contact.FirstName},</font></p>
<p class="p2" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="3"><span class="s1"></span><br></font></p>
<p class="p1" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="3"><span class="s1">The quarter is drawing to a close and we&nbsp;haven't&nbsp;connected yet to discuss your investment goals for the fiscal year. My focus is&nbsp;</span><span class="s2">specifically</span><span class="s1">&nbsp;supporting our existing clients to continue their portfolio development. Due to having a limited 700 properties this year for our 1,500+ clients, it very important that we set a game plan for your next&nbsp;acquisition. If we include new investors&nbsp;that are looking to start&nbsp;building their portfolios, the scarcity of&nbsp;opportunities becomes even thinner.</span></font></p>
<p class="p2" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="3"><span class="s1"></span><br></font></p>
<p class="p1" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span class="s1"><font size="3">We want to emphasize that supporting our existing clients to build their portfolios is what is most important to us. We want to ensure we are able to&nbsp;provide the&nbsp;opportunities you need for portfolio growth. Please let me know when is a good time for us to jump on a quick call to discuss your next&nbsp;acquisition whether it be next&nbsp;month or next year.&nbsp;</font></span></p>
<p class="p2" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font size="3"><span class="s1"></span><br></font></p>
<p class="p1" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><span class="s1"><font size="3">Best regards,</font></span></p>
